factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 4 problems
  The reel_script names the department as 'ஆனைமலை புலிகள் காப்பக துணை இயக்குநர் அலுவலகம்' (Anamalai Tiger Reserve), but the article says 'ஆனைலை' (Anaimalai/Anaiyalai) Tiger Reserve Deputy Director's office; the name is altered from the source.
  The reel_script says the 467-acre removal was carried out 'திருப்பூர் மாவட்டத்தில் உயர் நீதிமன்ற உத்தரவுப்படி', which is consistent, but the reel_script's 'அவிநாசியில் 467 ஏக்கர் பரப்பில்' attributes the whole district's 467 acres to Avinashi, whereas the article states the removal was across Tirupur district (Avinashi is only the dateline and the farmer's location), so the location is misattributed.
  The reel_script and slides say the 467-acre removal is complete ('முற்றிலும் அகற்றப்பட்டுள்ளது') while the article says the remaining work is ongoing; the reel_script's 'மீதமுள்ள பகுதிகளில் அகற்றும் பணி நடந்து வருகிறது' is present, but the caption's first line and the headline state the removal as settled without that qualifier, which is a mixing of facts.
  The slides_spec 'ஏன் அகற்றம்?' slide states 'முதல்வர் தனிப்பிரிவுக்கு புகார் அனுப்பப்பட்டது' as a separate reason, mixing the complaint (a procedural step) with the cause of removal, and omits that the complaint asked for removal from private lands with fees collected, an important part of the article.
