factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The article says the Soorasamharam is held at many temples across Tirupur, including Thirumurugan Poondi, Avinashi, Malaikoil, Alagumalai and Madhapur temples, but the reel_script and slides_spec frame it as taking place at Nallur ("நல்லூரில்"); the article only mentions Nallur for the morning abhishekam and the 6 PM Sakthivel/Soorasamharam event is listed under the Nallur temple, so the location framing in the headline/loc is only partly supported.
  The reel_script's first sentence says the Soorasamharam takes place in the Nallur area at 6 PM and then lists other temples, which mixes the Nallur 6 PM event with the general list of temples without clearly stating that the Nallur temple is the main venue.
  The caption adds a fixed date line 'நவம்பர் 14, சனிக்கிழமை' and English tags; the date and weekday are not stated in the article (only '10-ம் தேதி' and '16-ம் தேதி' appear), so this date detail is invented.
  The slides_spec 'வரும் விழாக்கள்' slide says 'பக்தர்கள் அனைவரும் கலந்துகொள்ளலாம்', an invented claim not present in the article.
